WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:03.173
- He's kinda like the joker.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.933
- We're eating easy
cheese for the first time.

00:00:06.933 --> 00:00:08.542
- Cheese that's easy.

00:00:08.542 --> 00:00:10.481
- I know that it comes from a can.

00:00:10.481 --> 00:00:11.807
And you squirt it
straight into your mouth.

00:00:11.807 --> 00:00:13.165
- I think kids at school had it

00:00:13.165 --> 00:00:14.907
and it was one of those
things that I wanted

00:00:14.907 --> 00:00:16.905
but my mom wouldn't let me have.

00:00:16.905 --> 00:00:20.016
- First most American day was
when I got my US citizenship

00:00:20.016 --> 00:00:21.960
and then the second one is the day

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.352
I get to try easy cheese.

00:00:23.352 --> 00:00:26.458
- This is like whip cream basically right?

00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:30.154
- We have a choice of
American versus cheddar.

00:00:30.154 --> 00:00:31.732
- It says it's made with real cheese,

00:00:31.732 --> 00:00:32.673
so that's comforting.

00:00:32.673 --> 00:00:34.705
- Also excellent source of calcium.

00:00:34.705 --> 00:00:35.955
- Ready?
- Yeah.

00:00:37.698 --> 00:00:38.928
- My hand's shaking.

00:00:38.928 --> 00:00:40.843
- It's not easy for YB.

00:00:40.843 --> 00:00:41.676
- Just a little like half and half.

00:00:41.676 --> 00:00:43.854
It's like a little pizza.

00:00:43.854 --> 00:00:46.104
(groaning)

00:00:47.201 --> 00:00:48.534
- That's a lot of cheese.

00:00:48.534 --> 00:00:50.077
I hope that was easy.

00:00:50.077 --> 00:00:51.624
- Easy, and a little cheesy.

00:00:51.624 --> 00:00:53.163
- A little stick.

00:00:53.163 --> 00:00:54.881
Kinda stuck to the roof of your mouth.

00:00:54.881 --> 00:00:55.714
- Cheddar.

00:00:57.086 --> 00:00:58.265
- What are you doing?

00:00:58.265 --> 00:01:00.789
- I'm chopping you with my cheese hands.

00:01:00.789 --> 00:01:02.223
- This is easy, I like this.

00:01:02.223 --> 00:01:04.630
- This is like a friend activity you know.

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:07.158
- I don't think you should take
this straight to your face.

00:01:07.158 --> 00:01:09.241
- Cheese, cheese, cheese!

00:01:10.328 --> 00:01:11.264
- This is delicious.

00:01:11.264 --> 00:01:14.299
- One, two, three, four,
I declare a cheese war.

00:01:14.299 --> 00:01:16.382
- Like a little mountain.

00:01:17.865 --> 00:01:20.170
Oh you got pretty far,
you got up to like here.

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:22.811
- Now we do your face.

00:01:22.811 --> 00:01:25.019
- Here.
- Touch our tips.

00:01:25.019 --> 00:01:26.478
- Don't laugh too much.

00:01:26.478 --> 00:01:28.772
- They're connected, look.

00:01:28.772 --> 00:01:30.763
- Why so serious?

00:01:30.763 --> 00:01:32.390
- I like this cheese.

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:35.474
I would've been in love
with this as a kid.

00:01:35.474 --> 00:01:36.619
- Do you feel like your life has changed

00:01:36.619 --> 00:01:37.931
for the better today?

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:39.196
- I think my life just got easy.

00:01:39.196 --> 00:01:40.848
- Or just got cheesy.

00:01:40.848 --> 00:01:42.096
- America's a melting pot

00:01:42.096 --> 00:01:45.095
and we're literally exemplifying
that in cheese form.

00:01:45.095 --> 00:01:47.168
Just everyone coming to America

00:01:47.168 --> 00:01:49.975
all in once, get out of your cans guys.

00:01:49.975 --> 00:01:51.145
- Come join the free world.

00:01:51.145 --> 00:01:53.518
- Everyone, come join us.

00:01:53.518 --> 00:01:55.935
(jazz music)

